  ── Keys ────────────────────────────────────────────────

    ↑↓ jk          move
    1–9            open that row
    esc            back to hosts
    n              new session
    enter          attach
    space          peek at the screen
    r f2           rename
    d              delete
    u              resume
    y              copy attach command
    w              next waiting session
    a              add host
    s              guided setup
    i              host details
    /              search every host
    alt+e          show ended
    q              quit
    ctrl+o         commands
